ty. They seem to be searching for something."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Griffin broke free of the blockade?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That does seem to be the case according to the communications logs."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I expect nothing less from the Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then the Military has probably mobilized to surround Ange."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That is a possibility. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you think she's still alive?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ordinary humans would've already become infected or even died, but Ange wouldn't succumb so easily. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even if she got turned into an ELID, that woman wouldn't make things easy for her enemies."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I see."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So what should we do next? Rendezvous with Griffin? Or rescue Ange?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We must wait for the night to pass. It's too dangerous to operate while the snow is still coming down."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But we're running out of..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":3,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you fancy getting shot full of holes by the new enemies, be my guest."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"New enemies? What's that all about?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1?","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can faintly perceive a resonance with someone like Lunasia."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you mean...?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bang! Bang!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"op